    <title>代币经济学：如何判断一个代币值不值得买</title>
    <link href="https://lucifer.ren/blog/2026/05/03/web3-tokenomics/"/>
    <id>https://lucifer.ren/blog/2026/05/03/web3-tokenomics/</id>
